 "landing.how_5": "Watch it live in the Admin dashboard: live map, trips, wallets and reports.",
 "landing.how_title": "Try a full trip in 2 minutes",
 "landing.limits_text": "Everything works, but data is stored only in this browser (localStorage) and shared between tabs of the same browser. There is no real SMS, payment or push. Other phones won't see your trips. For a real launch, the same logic moves to a server (see the design docs).",
